    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Brady is delighted to present this attractive three-bedroom semi-detached home with an attached garage, ideally situated on the sought-after Ballymakenny Road within a mature and well-established residential development.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises an entrance hall, spacious sitting room, kitchen, dining room, guest WC, three bedrooms, and a family bathroom.\n\nA standout feature of this property is the large, private walled rear garden, offering excellent outdoor space. \n\nConveniently located within walking distance of a range of local amenities, including primary and secondary schools, Our Lady of Lourdes Hospital, sports facilities, shops, and services, this property enjoys a highly desirable setting.\n\nWhether you are a first-time buyer, investor, or growing family seeking a home in a prime location, this property offers an excellent opportunity. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
